  "description": "FUVDUZ crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C92 H80 Cl6 Dy4 N6 O28 Zn2,2(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Zn1 (Zn) has 4 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Zn2 (Zn) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.453-3.955 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 97.46-113.57°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C92H80Cl6Dy4N6O28Zn2·2(CH4O). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
